        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emma Willis, Marvin Humes, will.i.am, Ricky Wilson, Kevin Simm\n- Events: The Voice UK series 5, The Voice UK final\n- Roles: hosts, coaches, winner, disc jockey, radio host\n- Organizations: Capital FM Network, Vodafone Big Top 40\n\nFacts:\n- Marvin Richard James Humes was born on 18 March 1985.\n- Marvin Humes is an English disc jockey and radio host.\n- Marvin Humes currently presents the late show across the UK's Capital FM Network.\n- Marvin Humes currently presents the Vodafone Big Top 40 chart show across UK commercial radio stations on Sunday afternoons.\n- The Voice UK series 5 is hosted by Emma Willis and Marvin Humes.\n- The Voice UK series 5 features will.i.am and Ricky Wilson as coaches.\n- Kevin Simm won The Voice UK on 9 April 2016.",
